      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_intro_001",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "终于……快到了。",
      "condition": { "type": "always" },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_intro_002",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_intro_002",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "这里应该就是地图上最后有官方标记的车站，后面的路恐怕只能步行了。",
      "condition": { "type": "always" },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_intro_003",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_intro_003",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "就算是想拖欠薪水也没必要躲这么远吧？我这位老雇主还真是富有冒险精神。",
      "condition": { "type": "always" },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_station_intro_004",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_station_intro_004",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker_id": "npc_bh",
      "text": "看样子太阳快落山了，事不宜迟，还是先抵达镇上安顿为好。再看看地图吧。",
      "condition": { "type": "always" },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_test_choice_001",
      "type": "choice",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "[Choice Test] 你准备走哪一条路？(3 options)",
      "condition": { "type": "always" },
      "params": {
        "choices": [
          { "choice_id": "test_left", "text": "向左走（死路，测试返回重选）", "condition": { "type": "always" }, "next_step": "step_test_wrong_001" },
          { "choice_id": "test_middle", "text": "向中间走（进入条件隐藏测试）", "condition": { "type": "always" }, "next_step": "step_test_choice_002" },
          { "choice_id": "test_right", "text": "向右走（进入 4 选项测试）", "condition": { "type": "always" }, "next_step": "step_test_right_001" }
        ]
      },
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_test_wrong_001",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "[Choice Test] 这是一条死路，你退了回来，重新看看该走哪条路。",
      "condition": { "type": "always" },
      "params": {},
      "next_step": "step_test_choice_001",
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
      "step_id": "step_test_choice_002",
      "type": "choice",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "text": "[Choice Test] 前面似乎有一扇锁住的门。(2 options, one condition-hidden)",
      "condition": { "type": "always" },
      "params": {
        "choices": [
          { "choice_id": "test_hidden_a", "text": "用测试钥匙开门（应被隐藏，未拥有 item_test_key）", "condition": { "type": "has_item", "id": "item_test_key" }, "next_step": "step_test_hidden_a_001" },
          { "choice_id": "test_visible_b", "text": "绕过去继续走", "condition": { "type": "always" }, "next_step": "step_test_end_001" }
        ]
      },
      "next_step": null,
      "is_save": false
    },
    {
